  "persona": "",
  "subject": "a husband who leaves his wife a short word in the steam on the bathroom mirror every morning before he goes to work, and finds one written back when he comes home",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien doo-wop, 1950s street-corner ballad style. Close-harmony backing singers on soft 'doo-wop' and 'ooh' syllables; slow 12/8 piano triplets; walking upright bass; light brushed snare; a breathy tenor sax answering the verses. Warm vintage room sound with soft plate reverb. A smooth male tenor lead with gentle falsetto lifts, a four-part male harmony behind. 72 BPM, Bb major. Tender, sweet and quietly playful. No trap beats, no autotune, no modern pop synths, no rock drums, no EDM.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n透早洗身軀 煙霧白白\n伊閣咧睏 我毋敢吵\n手指頭仔 佇鏡面\n寫一字 予伊看\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n毋是情批 嘛毋是詩\n干焦兩字 早安\n\n[Chorus]\n鏡面的字 慢慢仔消\n伊起床 拄好看著\n一世人的話 毋免講濟\n一工兩字 就夠\n\n[Verse]\n暗時轉來 我先開燈\n熱水一開 鏡閣霧去\n頂懸浮出 伊的字\n愛你 閣畫一粒心\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n伊的字 寫甲歪歪\n我看甲 笑出聲\n\n[Chorus]\n鏡面的字 慢慢仔消\n我歸身軀 煞燒起來\n一世人的話 毋免講濟\n一工兩字 就夠\n\n[Verse]\n十五年矣 鏡換兩面\n伊的頭毛 嘛白矣\n手指頭仔 猶原咧寫\n\n[Bridge]\n明仔早起 我欲寫啥\n我想規暝 想袂出來\n\n[Chorus]\n鏡面的字 慢慢仔消\n心內的字 袂消\n一世人的話 毋免講濟\n明仔早起 閣寫\n\n[Outro]\n早安 我的愛人",
